    # gg "Another ten minutes."
    gg "再过十分钟。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7043
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_00ebe152:

    # mc "Ten minutes. Long enough to think too much. Any ideas, what was that?"
    mc "十分钟。够想太多了。有什么想法，那东西是什么？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7045
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_a5a8d775:

    # gg "There are a couple of theories, but none really explain what's happening."
    gg "有几个理论，但都解释不了现在的情况。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7047
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_6b4e4f1d:

    # mc "Not much. I was hoping for at least a hint."
    mc "不多。我本来还指望至少有点线索。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7049
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_15f75b71:

    # gg "By appearance — a Faceless, but with an abnormal ability. Either a mutation, or something new."
    gg "从外表看——是无面者，但有异常能力。要么是变异，要么是新东西。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7052
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_900695d0:

    # gggg "I've never had the honor of being a test rat before."
    gggg "我以前还没荣幸当过实验鼠。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7054
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_b6d3481c:

    # mc "(That thing came for us. Something doesn’t add up…)"
    mc "（那东西是冲我们来的。有什么对不上……）"

