    mc "你真打算一直不说？还是终于肯开口了？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7295
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_76115544:

    # a "You're the leader now. My place is behind you — unseen."
    a "你现在是领队。我的位置在你身后——不露脸。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7297
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_978174fd:

    # k "Cut it out. You’re only digging yourself a deeper grave."
    k "别说了。你只是在给自己挖更深的坟。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7303
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_feff63bd:

    # mc "We're not leaving until you tell me everything."
    mc "你不把一切都告诉我，我们就不走。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7305
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_df619773:

    # mc "And if I'm the leader now, you'll follow my orders — understood?"
    mc "既然我现在是领队，你就得听我的命令——明白吗？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7306
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_bb8e4b4e_3:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7307
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_e0d9e8e7:

    # a "Hmpf."
    a "哼。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7311
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_159f586b:

    # mc "Are you kidding me!"
    mc "你逗我呢！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7316
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_9b1210bb:

    # k "One more twitch, and I’ll carve your throat open. Try me."
    k "再动一下，我就把你喉咙豁开。试试看。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7318
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7320
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_ab998e08:

    # mc "(She’s right. Cool it down, [mc].)"
    mc "（她说得对。冷静点，[mc]。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7324
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_40f71b31:

    # mc "(Even silent, she’s still one of us.)"
    mc "（就算不说话，她也是我们的人。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7327
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_12b6fd0f:

    # mc "(Yeah, that's the best move.)"
    mc "（嗯，这是最好的做法。）"

    # game/Story03.rpy:7329
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_71fae008:

    # mc "Maybe you know something?"
    mc "也许你知道点什么？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7333
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_e56be2ad:

    # k "Neither I nor my mute sister had a hand in this. Stop whining — it’s making you look pitiful."
    k "这事跟我、跟我那哑巴姐妹都没关系。别哼哼了——看着怪可怜的。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7335
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_9995c2fe:

    # mc "So it wasn’t your hand?"
    mc "所以不是你们干的？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7337
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_04f1ae85:

    # k "Who do you take me for? A murderer?"
    k "你把我当什么了？杀人犯？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7339
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7342
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_2cdc06dc:

    # mc "You’ve cut down more than most armies. Don’t act like the word doesn’t fit."
    mc "你砍掉的人比大多数军队还多。别装得这词跟你不搭。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7345
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_9c268761:

    # k "Don’t play dumb. You’ve slaughtered enough to know. The only difference is motive."
    k "别装傻。你杀得也够多了，心里清楚。区别只在动机。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7348
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_51e52378:

    # k "I kill because it’s beautiful."
    k "我杀人，是因为它美。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7351
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_7d95b7f7:

    # k "You kill because someone told you to. That’s your tragedy."
    k "你杀人，是因为有人让你杀。这就是你的悲剧。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7353
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7355
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_6494bad5:

    # mc "Fair enough. Truth is, if I wasn’t dragged into saving this place…"
    mc "说得也是。说实话，要不是被拖进来救这地方……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7358
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_9e28d6ad:

    # mc "I’m not even from here. Not from this planet. From the other side of the universe."
    mc "我根本不是这儿的人。不是这个星球的。我来自宇宙的另一边。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7360
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_8a1ff4a0:

    # mc "And what do I get back? Suspicion. Aggression. Treated like dirt."
    mc "我换来什么？猜忌。敌意。被当成垃圾。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7361
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_c54c0120:

    # mc "Yet still — I chose to help."
    mc "可即便如此——我还是选择帮忙。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7364
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_3c0439aa:

    # mc "You. Your mistress. With no intel, no backup, nothing."
    mc "帮你。帮你的女主人。没情报，没后援，什么都没有。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7369
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_bb8e4b4e_4:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7374
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_dc607cbe:

    # k "(Don’t.)"
    k "（别。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7376
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_a6e657f2:

    # gggg "(whisper) What do we do? He's on edge..."
    gggg "（低声）我们怎么办？他快绷不住了……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7377
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_a05f8c97:

    # gg "(whisper) We watch."
    gg "（低声）看着。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7380
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_752b8262:

    # gg "..."
    gg "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7394
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_790221dc:

    # mc "Right, I forgot..."
    mc "对了，我忘了……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7397
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_7a97854f:

    # mc "You understand only the language of violence."
    mc "你只听得懂暴力的语言。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7401
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_65535b28:

    # mc "Talk. Tell me what you know."
    mc "说。把你知道的告诉我。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7405
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_bb8e4b4e_5:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7409
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_a79c5b00:

    # k "Please. Don’t make me waste my blade on you."
    k "拜托。别让我把刀浪费在你身上。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7410
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_dbdef2f7:

    # k "(quiet) Begging doesn't suit you."
    k "（轻声）求人可不适合你。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7412
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_bdc5efa2:

    # mc "I’ve been patient long enough. That’s over."
    mc "我耐心够久了。到此为止。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7415
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_01e35740:

    # mc "If she won’t listen, then I’ll make her listen."
    mc "她要是不听，我就逼她听。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7431
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_b2323341:

    # k "Don’t push me."
    k "别逼我。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7433
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_d465bd31:

    # mc "I won`t repeat, answer. Now!"
    mc "我不重复，回答。现在！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7444
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_37af4d3a:

    # k "If you do, I’ll finish this in a heartbeat. That’s your last chance."
    k "你再动一下，我一瞬间就了结这事。这是你最后的机会。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7446
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_1d01ed27:

    # mc "Do you want it to end here? Fine. But you'll tell me first — who ordered it?"
    mc "你想让它在这儿结束？行。但你先告诉我——是谁下的令？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7454
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_1_45ee8c1e:

    # mc "(whisper) Seems, I have no choice..."
    mc "（低声）看来我没得选了……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7472
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_3ed7f492:

    # y "Enough. Both of you."
    y "够了。你们两个。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7474
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_7fce9bbd:

    # Mi "You've crossed the line."
    Mi "你越线了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7477
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_43a45d9f:

    # y "You. With me. The rest — to Intelligence HQ."
    y "你。跟我来。其余人——去情报总部。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7480
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_1d9165ae:

    # y "This concerns everyone. No exceptions."
    y "这关乎所有人。没有例外。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7482
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7487
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_f2ab70af:

    # a "Yes, chaplain."
    a "是，随军牧师。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7489
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_a1bbd0ba:

    # k "Understood."
    k "明白。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7491
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_45e8037e:

    # y "Miriel — lead them."
    y "米莉尔——带他们去。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7493
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_10356780:

    # y "And listen well: do not engage. Not a word, not a blade."
    y "听好了：不许动手。一句话都不许，一刀都不许。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7495
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_6e910f0b:

    # Mi "Yes, Teacher."
    Mi "是，老师。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7498
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_6669ff6e:

    # k "(whisper) You’ve no idea how much I wanted you to show up."
    k "（低声）你不知道我多希望你能出现。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7499
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_61bc2e42:

    # Mi "(whisper) I doubt it."
    Mi "（低声）我怀疑。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7500
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_bb8e4b4e_1:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7502
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_850ef128:

    # b "..."
    b "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7504
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_bdb0e556:

    # y "Now. What are you doing here?"
    y "那么。你在这儿干什么？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7506
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_f1ea2780:

    # mc "Trying to help, Miriel. As much as I can — in the Lower City."
    mc "想帮忙，米莉尔。尽我所能——在下城。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7508
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_12aed2c5:

    # y "And what did I tell you?"
    y "我跟你说过什么？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7510
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_e29b2c45:

    # mc "Go to the tower. I remember."
    mc "去高塔。我记得。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7512
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_9f8c5c60:

    # mc "(This can’t go on.)"
    mc "（不能再这样下去了。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7514
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_fcf845a0:

    # mc "With all respect — I’ve had enough. I need answers."
    mc "恕我直言——我受够了。我需要答案。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7517
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_7bf8b03a:

    # mc "What are we even fighting for? What am I fighting for?"
    mc "我们到底在为什么而战？我又在为什么而战？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7520
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_b53a122f:

    # mc "This silence, it isn’t protection. It’s humiliation."
    mc "这种沉默，不是保护。是羞辱。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7523
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_f8aa0477:

    # mc "You all know what’s going on. You know everything about me. And I’m left in the dark."
    mc "你们都知道发生了什么。你们对我了如指掌。而我被蒙在鼓里。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7526
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_991ab2c5:

    # mc "So please… tell me something. Anything."
    mc "所以拜托……告诉我点什么。什么都行。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7528
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_71a86863:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7530
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_2b7ff1db:

    # aa "We decide who lives and who disappears without a trace."
    aa "谁活、谁消失得无影无踪，由我们决定。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7531
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_294aa7c4:

    # aa "So don’t do anything stupid. {w}You understand me?"
    aa "所以别干傻事。{w}明白我的意思吗？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7534
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_b70ee927:

    # am "(If the presence behind him reacts to her, we may have less time than I thought...)"
    am "（要是他身后那个存在对她有反应，我们剩下的时间比我想的还少……）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7535
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_e0513d45:

    # y "(She woke something in it. Just like in the anomaly.)"
    y "（她把它里面的什么东西唤醒了。就像那次异常一样。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7538
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_a901cd97:

    # a "This is your final move. Fail me again… and your piece is swept from the board."
    a "这是你最后一步。再让我失望……你这颗棋子就从棋盘上抹掉。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7540
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_71a86863_1:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7552
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_b357cb82:

    # y "Alright. I’ll give you this chance."
    y "好。我给你这个机会。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7554
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_9ccf2ff9:

    # y "But whether you can handle it or not — that’s up to you."
    y "但你受不受得住——那看你自己。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7562
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_01d523d1:

    # mc "(ARGH, MY HEAD IS SPLITTING OPEN!)"
    mc "（啊，我脑袋要裂开了！）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7563
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_b1c08076:

    # mc "(NO, STOP FEELING SORRY FOR YOURSELF, HOLD IT TOGETHER, HOLD IT...)"
    mc "（不，别自怜自艾了，撑住，撑住……）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7565
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_b19f209b:

    # mc "(WHY DOES IT HURT SO DAMN MUCH!)"
    mc "（为什么他妈这么疼！）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7573
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7575
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_f3d09fd8:

    # y "Don’t leave my side. Not an inch."
    y "别离开我身边。一寸都不许。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7577
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_36b45995:

    # mc "We’re… floating in midair?!"
    mc "我们……飘在半空中？！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7579
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_e1c02d4b:

    # y "No. We haven’t moved from the starting point. Not even a hair’s breadth."
    y "不。我们一步都没离开起点。连一根头发丝的宽度都没有。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7582
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_d35a52e6:

    # mc "This — this is the same device from the Ark."
    mc "这——这就是方舟里的那个装置。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7585
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_bf20aeb4:

    # y "This is your goal. And the only way back home."
    y "这是你的目标。也是唯一回家的路。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7586
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_a759d206:

    # mc "(If this gets me home, it’s the only shot I’ve got.)"
    mc "（要是这能带我回家，那就是我唯一的机会。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7589
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_fcc7eca0:

    # mc "You’ve got to be kidding me. Lora!"
    mc "你逗我呢。洛拉！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7590
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_bf413aff:

    # L "Status reports, now! And you — get those BAR crates moved, don’t just stand there!"
    L "状态报告，现在！还有你——把那些 BAR 箱子搬走，别站着发愣！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7593
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_762d61ac:

    # ggg "On it!"
    ggg "马上！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7595
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_561bf8ea:

    # L "We don’t have time to waste. The gates won’t wait for us!"
    L "我们没时间浪费。门不会等我们！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7598
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_b6799be6:

    # a "Yes, ma’am!"
    a "是，长官！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7604
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_37c402c1:

    # ggg "All hail Astoria!"
    ggg "阿斯托里亚万岁！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7605
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_d6e78091:

    # aa "With faith and glory!"
    aa "以信念与荣耀！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7607
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_7b1b6d39:

    # aa "I see my expectations of you were right. Keep it up!"
    aa "看来我对你的期望没错。继续保持！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7609
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_fe58472f:

    # L "You’ve given me so much already… so many discoveries, so many mysteries to unravel. It makes me feel alive again."
    L "你已经给了我太多……那么多发现，那么多待解的谜。让我重新觉得自己活着。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7613
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_6d5f9924:

    # aa "And despite all that, you still wish to return?"
    aa "即便如此，你还是想回去？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7615
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_06f35b7b:

    # L "Even with all of this, my heart is restless. He’s still there, without me… I can’t leave him waiting forever."
    L "就算有这一切，我的心还是不安。他还在那儿，没有我……我不能让他一直等下去。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7618
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_f7cc8ef1:

    # aa "I know those feelings well, my dear. And believe me, I want to see you happy too, but… We cannot."
    aa "这种感觉我很清楚，亲爱的。信我，我也想看你幸福，可是……我们不能。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7619
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_0afd4568:

    # aa "And your brilliant mind knows this. Doesn’t it?"
    aa "而你那颗聪明的脑袋也清楚这点。对吧？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7628
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_3b66c7b4:

    # aa "You really are a treasure."
    aa "你真是个宝贝。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7629
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_d3996593:

    # aa "Every time I watch you from afar — I can’t help but admire you."
    aa "每次远远看着你——我都忍不住钦佩你。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7630
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_680b050f:

    # aa "You remind me of my little daughter… You and she share such similar views on science."
    aa "你让我想起我的小女儿……你和她对科学的看法那么像。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7632
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_fddc4234:

    # L "You mean Flora?"
    L "你说弗洛拉？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7638
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_f507a007:

    # g "Doctor Lora! We’re ready to open the gates!"
    g "洛拉博士！我们准备好开门了！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7640
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_6843dca4:

    # L "Good work."
    L "干得好。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7643
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_5aefce8a:

    # mc "(She doesn’t have the scar yet… So this happened afterward.)"
    mc "（她还没有那道疤……所以这是之后发生的。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7645
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_07240511:

    # mc "They’re going to send her back? That can’t be right."
    mc "他们要送她回去？这不对吧。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7647
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_71a86863_2:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7648
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_db85b50c:

    # y "Not exactly."
    y "不完全是。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7649
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_02e15a7b:

    # y "Miriel told you, didn’t she? About our race’s mistake."
    y "米莉尔跟你说过吧？关于我们种族的错误。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7651
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_d04b62d2:

    # mc "About the ears? Yeah, I kind of remember."
    mc "关于耳朵？嗯，我大概记得。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7653
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_977d5ea2:

    # y "The truth is… we weren’t the first to defy the laws of creation."
    y "事实是……我们不是第一个违抗造物法则的。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7654
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_a2c63ab2:

    # y "Long before us, the younger lady did."
    y "远在我们之前，那位更年轻的女士就这么做了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7656
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_83d29ecb:

    # y "In the end, Astoria was forced to imprison her own sister in the depths of a tomb."
    y "最终，阿斯托里亚被迫把自己妹妹囚禁在一座墓穴深处。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7658
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_7f811734:

    # y "However..."
    y "然而……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7661
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_d2558c8a:

    # L "The readings are shifting — this isn’t Earth!"
    L "读数在变——这不是地球！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7663
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_1d42bf2e:

    # L "Adjust parameters and flood the BAR, now!"
    L "调整参数，给 BAR 注能，现在！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7664
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_95231eb8:

    # g "Yes, ma’am!"
    g "是，长官！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7666
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_202b8315:

    # mc "However?"
    mc "然而？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7668
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_e9b9ae17:

    # y "She refused to accept it, deciding she’d get her back by any means necessary."
    y "她拒绝接受，决定不惜一切把她弄回来。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7670
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_cdf683da:

    # y "And she’s a key figure in all of this."
    y "而她是这一切里的关键人物。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7671
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_15258e30:

    # g "We’ve done it—"
    g "我们成功了——"

# game/Story03.rpy:7673
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_9afd88e0:

    # L "No! Don’t celebrate yet. Not until the Ark’s connection is secured."
    L "不！先别庆祝。方舟的连接还没固定好。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7681
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_37b52a75:

    # L "(whispering) Just a little longer… [mc], I’ll see you again…"
    L "（低声）再等一会儿……[mc]，我会再见到你的……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7683
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_6652be63:

    # aa "Something’s wrong."
    aa "出问题了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7685
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_ddde6779:

    # L "Bring more, this won’t be enough!"
    L "再拿一些来，这不够！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7687
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_7c1e1c9f:

    # aa "(whispering) No…"
    aa "（低声）不……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7694
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_c1fe3d7f:

    # mc "LORA!"
    mc "洛拉！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7697
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_b9f86ef5:

    # a "Sister… save—"
    a "姐妹……救——"

# game/Story03.rpy:7708
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_fe8bc491:

    # am "Enough."
    am "够了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7710
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_3b00051b:

    # am "Why did you expose him to that? He was never meant to witness it."
    am "你为什么让他看到那个？他本不该看到。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7712
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_4b475fa3:

    # mc "(I… can’t… speak!)"
    mc "（我……说……不出话！）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7714
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_e92bf14a:

    # am "Child, don’t try. You’re far too weak right now."
    am "孩子，别试了。你现在太虚弱了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7716
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_7c87e695:

    # y "He’s not like the other versions. He’s stronger."
    y "他跟其他版本不一样。他更强。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7718
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_e8fe0f14:

    # am "Who gave you the audacity to grant him that sight?"
    am "谁给你的胆子，让他看见那个？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7720
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_71a86863_3:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7722
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_5d9f22ac:

    # mc "I…"
    mc "我……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7727
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_791e8fe1:

    # mc "N-not…"
    mc "不、不……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7732
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_c7443293:

    # mc "W-weak!"
    mc "虚、虚弱！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7735
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_8b797fa0:

    # am "That’s enough."
    am "够了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7738
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_b9bd232b:

    # y "(whispering) Why did you…"
    y "（低声）你为什么……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7739
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_d779cba2:

    # am "Everything that happens next will be on your conscience."
    am "接下来发生的一切，都算在你良心上。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7741
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_c56d8e88:

    # y "Fine. Then may I?"
    y "行。那我可以吗？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7743
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_50e57c3b:

    # am "Later. You’re being followed."
    am "之后再说。有人跟着你。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7745
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_71a86863_4:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7747
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_2_7cc313fd:

    # am "And this is how you repay me for saving you?"
    am "这就是你报答我救你的方式？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7761
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7764
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_2170b42f:

    # mc "Miriel?"
    mc "米莉尔？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7769
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_efb5df2b:

    # Mi "Awake, finally?"
    Mi "终于醒了？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7772
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7776
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_5d5ea5a2:

    # Mi "How are you holding up?"
    Mi "你还撑得住吗？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7778
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_22cc9567:

    # mc "Where are we?"
    mc "我们在哪儿？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7781
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_661d2740:

    # Mi "Recon HQ. Safe, for now."
    Mi "侦察总部。暂时安全。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7784
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_d175e169:

    # mc "Yong?"
    mc "勇？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7787
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_78a22df8:

    # Mi "Talking with Winter. Nothing urgent."
    Mi "在跟温特谈话。不急。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7791
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7793
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_3c9f286c:

    # mc "Lora..."
    mc "洛拉……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7795
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_1dcb9a5e:

    # mc "I saw her… like I remembered, but not the same."
    mc "我看见她了……跟我记忆里一样，又不一样。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7800
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_1e0e2567:

    # mc "Not the one I met here."
    mc "不是在这儿遇见的那个她。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7804
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_5711a4fd:

    # mc "Tell me…"
    mc "告诉我……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7806
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_60cf0c61:

    # mc "what would you do if the person you loved was gone for good?"
    mc "要是你爱的人永远回不来了，你会怎么做？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7812
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_d852b200:

    # mc "If everything you leaned on was just… out of reach forever?"
    mc "要是你依赖的一切……永远都够不着了？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7818
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_da3fdbf1:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7821
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_4fde1df4:

    # Mi "She’d want you to keep moving. To survive."
    Mi "她会希望你继续往前走。活下去。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7825
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_e7288f07:

    # Mi "…That’s all you can do."
    Mi "……你能做的只有这个。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7829
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7833
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_da3fdbf1_1:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7841
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_c4a530d7:

    # mc "Sorry. Didn’t think I had any tears left."
    mc "抱歉。我以为我已经没眼泪了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7844
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_c8ae85d3:

    # Mi "Not exactly the time for it… but I get it."
    Mi "现在不是哭的时候……不过我懂。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7847
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_e7367d2a:

    # Mi "Still… glad to see you made it back."
    Mi "不过……很高兴看到你回来了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7851
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_05df7b5e:

    # Mi "And thank you… for not leaving us behind."
    Mi "还有，谢谢你……没有丢下我们。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7853
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_dd66998d:

    # mc "How could I ever walk away, after everything?"
    mc "经历了这一切，我怎么可能走得开？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7855
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_da3fdbf1_2:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7860
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_b79edc31:

    # Mi "…Thank you."
    Mi "……谢谢。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7867
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_92f1bcbf:

    # y "Awake?"
    y "醒了？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7870
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_964e3083:

    # mc "Looks like it."
    mc "看着像。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7872
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_598b874f:

    # y "Good. Then let's move. They're waiting for you in there."
    y "很好。那就走吧。他们在里面等你。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7882
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_3ba1b1d2:

    # w "Our mission is to secure the safety of our people. At any cost."
    w "我们的任务是保障人民安全。不惜一切代价。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7892
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_825b9da4:

    # g "With all due respect, that's absolute nonsense! The Arks Federation has been ignoring us this whole time."
    g "恕我直言，这纯属胡扯！方舟联邦一直对我们不闻不问。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7895
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_d6950376:

    # g "Why should we be the ones to—"
    g "凭什么要我们去——"

# game/Story03.rpy:7897
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_0d04128e:

    # w "..."
    w "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7900
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_56826835:

    # w "Anyone else agree with him?"
    w "还有谁同意他？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7903
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_4b340443:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7904
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_85381107:

    # w "We all make mistakes; they're no exception."
    w "谁都会犯错；他们也不例外。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7907
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_3bde74c3:

    # w "The question is whether our pride is strong enough to bury the hatchet."
    w "问题在于，我们的自尊够不够强，能把旧账埋了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7910
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_53ad53a4:

    # w "I understand how you feel. But right now, we must survive!"
    w "我理解你的感受。但现在，我们必须活下去！"

# game/Story03.rpy:7912
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_54cae50b:

    # ggg "(Rumours)"
    ggg "（传闻）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7914
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_d1ea851a:

    # w "And again we meet."
    w "我们又见面了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7917
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_09e90edd:

    # w "The first time I wasn't sure. But seeing you here - accept my greeting."
    w "第一次我还不确定。但在这儿见到你——接受我的问候吧。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7920
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_015080fd:

    # mc "Glad to meet you. What’s the situation?"
    mc "幸会。情况怎么样？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7925
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_5b055e29:

    # w "Monsters surround us like wolves. If they close the ring — there won't be an exit left."
    w "怪物像狼群一样围着我们。它们一旦合围——就没有退路了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7929
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_5aa9ed78:

    # w "Our way is through the northern tunnel. Old, half-collapsed, but it still holds. That's where we'll force our path."
    w "我们的路在北边隧道。老旧，半塌，但还撑得住。我们就从那儿杀出去。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7931
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_8b3034f8:

    # y "It's blocked. Half the people won't fit through."
    y "堵住了。一半人都过不去。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7932
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_6570d3bb:

    # w "I know. But there's no other route. Either we go and take the risk, or we wait here until we're eaten."
    w "我知道。可没别的路。要么冒险走，要么在这儿等着被吃。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7935
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_4e6a411a:

    # Mi "And what if it's a trap?"
    Mi "那要是个陷阱呢？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7937
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_ea3e4f70:

    # w "Then we'll die with weapons in our hands. Not cowering in basements like rats."
    w "那就拿着武器死。而不是像老鼠一样缩在地下室里。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7939
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_ed23b569:

    # mc "What if we put up a fight?"
    mc "要是我们打一场呢？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7941
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_2f1c6a0a:

    # w "Too many of them. It won't work."
    w "太多了。行不通。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7942
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_147dc9ee:

    # w "And with civilians around, it would turn into a slaughter."
    w "而且带着平民，那会变成一场屠杀。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7945
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_c1c2ad6a:

    # y "That many people won't get through. There's no choice."
    y "那么多人过不去。没得选。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7946
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_7be1ebc5:

    # w "I'd give my life to get everyone out — no exceptions."
    w "我愿意拿命换所有人出去——一个都不落下。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7948
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_640ca5ee:

    # mc "Yong’s right. It’s suicide."
    mc "勇说得对。这是自杀。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7949
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_d5b50506:

    # mc "Clearing a path for hundreds is already near impossible. And you want more than that…"
    mc "给几百人清出一条路已经几乎不可能。而你还想要更多……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7951
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_ceece35d:

    # w "So what do you propose?"
    w "那你有什么提议？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7953
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_6a6b86f0:

    # mc "Do you know about Sector 3?"
    mc "你知道第 3 区吗？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7956
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_7f5ee279:

    # mc "Could their numbers be enough to hold the lower city?"
    mc "他们的人数够守住下城吗？"

# game/Story03.rpy:7963
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_f13f8809:

    # y "That would be an advantage."
    y "那会是个优势。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7965
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_97679a9c:

    # y "But if you send them all — our front will collapse, and then it will be the end for everyone."
    y "可要是把他们全派出去——我们的前线就垮了，那所有人都完了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7967
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_1c04ce1e:

    # w "We'll manage without their help."
    w "没有他们帮忙我们也撑得住。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7971
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_c72e6b67:

    # mc "(Without them, reaching the tower will be impossible. And asking the peacekeepers now would be too late.)"
    mc "（没有他们，到高塔根本不可能。而现在去求维和部队又太晚了。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7973
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_4a8de014:

    # Mi "If I may, I know someone who can actually help."
    Mi "如果可以，我认识一个真能帮上忙的人。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7977
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_c651dfa6:

    # Mi "Flora Sevin. Sharp, capable… and reliable."
    Mi "弗洛拉·塞文。敏锐、能干……而且靠得住。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7979
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_7470b4b8:

    # mc "(Exactly — if she can help them, they'll have reason to return the favor!)"
    mc "（没错——要是她能帮他们，他们就有理由还这个人情！）"

# game/Story03.rpy:7988
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_6b3a8b6e:

    # mc "I need to contact her."
    mc "我得联系她。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7992
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_6917bf14:

    # w "A hopeless task. At best you'll get a narcissistic commander on the line."
    w "没戏。顶多能接到一个自恋的指挥官。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7994
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_8daa42b6:

    # mc "You’re not the last authority here. Don’t tell me you’ve got no pull."
    mc "你不是这儿唯一的权威。别告诉我你没点门路。"

# game/Story03.rpy:7996
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_71a86863:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:7998
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_3d2def36:

    # w "He has his own demons."
    w "他有他自己的心魔。"

# game/Story03.rpy:8003
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_4c29bf9b:

    # w "You go to Sector 3. We stay here until you return."
    w "你们去第 3 区。我们在这儿等你们回来。"

# game/Story03.rpy:8005
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_38d29f73:

    # w "Two days. If you don't come back… you'll be the ones blamed for sending us into the tunnel."
    w "两天。要是你们不回来……把我们送进隧道这锅就由你们背。"

# game/Story03.rpy:8013
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_13f1a8bd:

    # gg "Mr. Winter, for that they need a transport to get—"
    gg "温特先生，为此他们需要一艘运输船才能——"

# game/Story03.rpy:8015
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_2ca2db85:

    # w "He will take them there."
    w "他会送他们过去。"

# game/Story03.rpy:8017
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_71a86863_1:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:8018
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_25079f96:

    # w "We'll keep an eye on your Elves."
    w "我们会看好你们的精灵。"

# game/Story03.rpy:8020
translate chinese act3_5chapter2_3_37ba6b04:

    # w "Then let's get to it. I pray for your success."
    w "那就开始吧。我祝你们成功。"

