# game/Story03.rpy:9921
translate chinese ivy_meetings_58c321c6:

    # mc "Ivy? ...A lot went down."
    mc "艾薇？……出了不少事。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9923
translate chinese ivy_meetings_3b656acf:

    # i "Be clearer. You look like you’re about to jump off a roof."
    i "说清楚点。你这表情像是要去跳楼。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9924
translate chinese ivy_meetings_ad35ac65:

    # i "More than once, actually..."
    i "还是跳不止一次那种……"

# game/Story03.rpy:9927
translate chinese ivy_meetings_80e8df9f:

    # i "And tell me it wasn’t *you* who pushed Miriel into that state?"
    i "还有，告诉我把米莉尔弄成那样的*不是*你？"

# game/Story03.rpy:9929
translate chinese ivy_meetings_e0b52c65:

    # mc "Call it a misunderstanding."
    mc "算是误会吧。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9932
translate chinese ivy_meetings_950a57d7:

    # mc "Ember wanted answers, Miriel tried to shield me… and it spiraled."
    mc "恩伯要答案，米莉尔想护着我……然后就失控了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9936
translate chinese ivy_meetings_3a89f0ee:

    # i "Wait. What’s with your neck?"
    i "等等。你脖子怎么回事？"

# game/Story03.rpy:9938
translate chinese ivy_meetings_88cf2e63:

    # mc "It’s nothing."
    mc "没什么。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9940
translate chinese ivy_meetings_4db26f2a:

    # i "Doesn’t look like ‘nothing’ to me."
    i "在我看可不像“没什么”。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9943
translate chinese ivy_meetings_0d78b770:

    # i "If I remember right... you were talking with Flora, weren’t you?"
    i "我没记错的话……你当时在跟弗洛拉说话，对吧？"

# game/Story03.rpy:9944
translate chinese ivy_meetings_f1a9719d:

    # i "And Ember showed up around then… so you clashed?"
    i "然后恩伯正好那时候出现……所以你们起冲突了？"

# game/Story03.rpy:9949
translate chinese ivy_meetings_63addb4d:

    # i "Information… you said something that struck a nerve. Otherwise she wouldn’t have lost it enough to burn you."
    i "情报……你说了什么戳到她神经的话。不然她不会失控到烧你。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9950
translate chinese ivy_meetings_4bd60baf:

    # i "So either you provoked her, or you told her something important."
    i "所以要么是你激了她，要么是你告诉了她什么重要的东西。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9955
translate chinese ivy_meetings_48ba3306:

    # i "Miriel, judging by the look of her, tried to step in but couldn’t. And yet—you’re still standing here."
    i "看米莉尔那样子，她想插手却没插成。可你——还站在这儿。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9957
translate chinese ivy_meetings_bf407efd:

    # i "So? Am I close?"
    i "怎么样？我猜得接近吗？"

# game/Story03.rpy:9958
translate chinese ivy_meetings_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:9960
translate chinese ivy_meetings_854887cc:

    # mc "That whole deduction of yours — you pulled it out of thin air?"
    mc "你那一整套推理——凭空编的？"

# game/Story03.rpy:9963
translate chinese ivy_meetings_334b91be:

    # i "Just thinking out loud."
    i "就是随口说说。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9965
translate chinese ivy_meetings_65b68815:

    # i "So… was I right?"
    i "那……我说对了吗？"

# game/Story03.rpy:9967
translate chinese ivy_meetings_881e1ab2:

    # mc "Impressive."
    mc "厉害。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9968
translate chinese ivy_meetings_b0f73ca4:

    # mc "(Hard to believe this is the same girl who used to work at that club…)"
    mc "（真难相信这就是以前在那家夜店干活的姑娘……）"

# game/Story03.rpy:9974
translate chinese ivy_meetings_ced3b159:

    # mc "Spot on."
    mc "分毫不差。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9977
translate chinese ivy_meetings_974f004a:

    # mc "Honestly, I didn’t expect it to turn out like this either."
    mc "说实话，我也没想到会变成这样。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9978
translate chinese ivy_meetings_2670ceaf:

    # mc "Everyone keeps saying ‘don’t do this, don’t do that,’ but no one ever explains a damn thing. Just makes my life unbearable."
    mc "人人都说“别干这个，别干那个”，可谁都不肯解释一句。只是让我日子更难过。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9981
translate chinese ivy_meetings_38504b0c:

    # i "I could…"
    i "我可以……"

# game/Story03.rpy:9983
translate chinese ivy_meetings_0054e596:

    # mc "You’re serious?"
    mc "你说真的？"

# game/Story03.rpy:9985
translate chinese ivy_meetings_aa2c368b:

    # i "Why not. Let’s sit down somewhere — I’ll tell you."
    i "有什么不行的。找个地方坐下——我告诉你。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9987
translate chinese ivy_meetings_6f3d4875:

    # i "..."
    i "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:9989
translate chinese ivy_meetings_5d74a51b:

    # mc "That’s it? Just like that?"
    mc "就这样？这么简单？"

# game/Story03.rpy:9991
translate chinese ivy_meetings_8938d056:

    # i "What, were you expecting an interrogation? No, just a talk. And yeah, I’m in the mood for a little exposition tour."
    i "怎么，你以为要被审问？不，就是聊聊天。而且我还真有点兴致来个背景讲解。"

# game/Story03.rpy:9993
translate chinese ivy_meetings_e6b7da04:

    # mc "Expo what?"
    mc "背景什么？"

# game/Story03.rpy:9996
translate chinese ivy_meetings_2942e1c2:

    # i "Forget it. Just move before Ember finds someone else to take it out on."
    i "算了。快走，趁恩伯还没找别人出气。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10015
translate chinese ivy_meetings_bd1f39c3:

    # i "Come on in, don’t be shy. No one’s been here for ages."
    i "进来吧，别害羞。这儿好久没人来了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10018
translate chinese ivy_meetings_e2ec93ab:

    # mc "So… what are we doing here?"
    mc "那……我们来这儿干嘛？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10022
translate chinese ivy_meetings_e94af233:

    # i "You need info. And I need to get properly drunk before I spill it."
    i "你需要情报。而我得先喝到位，才肯往外倒。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10024
translate chinese ivy_meetings_0d945193:

    # mc "Those two things… connected somehow?"
    mc "这两件事……有关系吗？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10026
translate chinese ivy_meetings_79eaef6f:

    # i "Hmm… yeah, that’ll work."
    i "嗯……有，这样正好。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10029
translate chinese ivy_meetings_ddfa0364:

    # i "Everybody’s got skeletons. And I’m not the type to dig up the past sober."
    i "谁都有点见不得人的事。而我可不是那种清醒着挖旧账的人。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10032
translate chinese ivy_meetings_89d43927:

    # i "And here comes the cavalry."
    i "救兵到了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10037
translate chinese ivy_meetings_e75a2ef8:

    # mc "Used to be my friend too, once."
    mc "以前也是我的朋友。曾经。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10039
translate chinese ivy_meetings_6f3d4875_1:

    # i "..."
    i "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10041
translate chinese ivy_meetings_2b0aa5d7:

    # i "Divorce?"
    i "离婚了？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10046
translate chinese ivy_meetings_31eaad1e:

    # i "Thought so. Want a drink?"
    i "我就知道。来一杯？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10053
translate chinese ivy_meetings_0b7ce6ef:

    # mc "Quit a while back."
    mc "早戒了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10055
translate chinese ivy_meetings_6f3d4875_2:

    # i "..."
    i "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10058
translate chinese ivy_meetings_ff32cea2:

    # i "Smart."
    i "明智。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10064
translate chinese ivy_meetings_45580243:

    # i "So what did you promise Ember?"
    i "那你答应恩伯什么了？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10066
translate chinese ivy_meetings_841818e8:

    # mc "Everything I’ve got."
    mc "我所有的一切。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10068
translate chinese ivy_meetings_5f798eb5:

    # i "No wonder you pissed her off. And Miriel?"
    i "难怪你把她惹毛了。那米莉尔呢？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10072
translate chinese ivy_meetings_ee6f3223:

    # mc "I traded info about Yong for power. She… didn’t take it well."
    mc "我拿勇的情报换力量。她……接受不了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10077
translate chinese ivy_meetings_fcac034b:

    # i "You realize you’re standing between two fires now?"
    i "你意识到你现在夹在两团火中间了吧？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10078
translate chinese ivy_meetings_99e9ca99:

    # i "For Ember, he’s her father’s killer. For Miriel—he’s family."
    i "对恩伯来说，他是杀父仇人。对米莉尔来说——他是家人。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10080
translate chinese ivy_meetings_c00e4e98:

    # mc "Hold up — he really killed her father?"
    mc "等等——他真杀了她父亲？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10083
translate chinese ivy_meetings_4bc1332c:

    # i "On Astoria’s orders. Funny, huh?"
    i "奉阿斯托里亚之命。好笑吧？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10085
translate chinese ivy_meetings_49e6755a:

    # mc "What? But why?!"
    mc "什么？可为什么？！"

# game/Story03.rpy:10089
translate chinese ivy_meetings_9faea5ae:

    # i "Didn’t share her candy, so she threw a tantrum. Kidding."
    i "没分她糖吃，她就闹脾气了。开玩笑的。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10091
translate chinese ivy_meetings_30bd89e0:

    # i "It was over the Tomb in the main tower. The old guard wanted it destroyed. Astoria didn’t. Her love for her sister clouded her judgment."
    i "起因是主塔里的那座墓。老卫队想把它毁掉。阿斯托里亚不肯。对妹妹的爱蒙住了她的判断。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10093
translate chinese ivy_meetings_5bb6c988:

    # i "So now Ember ‘helps.’ In reality, she just watches. Doesn’t even value her own people."
    i "所以现在恩伯“帮忙”。实际上，她只是看着。连自己人都不当回事。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10095
translate chinese ivy_meetings_741dc9dc:

    # mc "But weren’t she and Astoria friends?"
    mc "可她和阿斯托里亚不是朋友吗？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10097
translate chinese ivy_meetings_2f629775:

    # i "No. Just a deal. Strictly business."
    i "不是。只是交易。纯粹公事。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10103
translate chinese ivy_meetings_a2651c75:

    # i "And if anyone finds out I’m talking — we’re both dead and buried before dawn."
    i "要是有人知道我在说这些——我们俩天亮前就会被埋了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10104
translate chinese ivy_meetings_074a3807:

    # i "And they’ll probably say we were some tragic couple. Horrifying, really."
    i "而且他们八成会说我们是一对苦命鸳鸯。想想都可怕。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10106
translate chinese ivy_meetings_5e095bc2:

    # mc "That’s one rumor I could live without."
    mc "这种传闻我宁可不要。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10109
translate chinese ivy_meetings_371e7efb:

    # i "Tch, you could’ve played along, you know."
    i "啧，你配合一下会死啊。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10113
translate chinese ivy_meetings_e5b549ee:

    # i "Your turn now. What, thought this was free?"
    i "轮到你了。怎么，以为这是免费的？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10115
translate chinese ivy_meetings_ed87226f:

    # mc "What do you want?"
    mc "你想要什么？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10121
translate chinese ivy_meetings_782302e5:

    # i "A story about your broken heart. We women eat that stuff up."
    i "一个你心碎的故事。我们女人最爱听这个。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10122
translate chinese ivy_meetings_f76abebe:

    # i "And besides - You owe me for running my mouth."
    i "再说——我这张嘴可为你跑了不少，你欠我的。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10124
translate chinese ivy_meetings_d836cdb6:

    # mc "(When did it all fall apart… Was it when I tried to bring her back? Or when I lost my son?)"
    mc "（这一切是什么时候崩的……是我试图把她带回来的时候？还是我失去儿子的时候？）"

# game/Story03.rpy:10126
translate chinese ivy_meetings_e2e3c42e:

    # mc "Most of my life, I lived in the dark. First hiding from my parents. Then from bullets. Just… trying to survive."
    mc "我大半辈子都活在暗处。先躲父母。再躲子弹。就……为了活下去。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10129
translate chinese ivy_meetings_91623206:

    # mc "Coward. That’s me in a word."
    mc "懦夫。一个词就能概括我。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10130
translate chinese ivy_meetings_6ac78bf5:

    # mc "And I’d have probably ended up in a ditch if not for her. My sun in the dark."
    mc "要不是她，我大概早死在哪个沟里了。我黑暗里的太阳。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10131
translate chinese ivy_meetings_00ebbaab:

    # mc "Until she was gone. Vanished. And when I saw her again… I was terrified."
    mc "直到她走了。消失了。等我再见到她……我怕了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10134
translate chinese ivy_meetings_6f3d4875_3:

    # i "..."
    i "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10136
translate chinese ivy_meetings_8c46a397:

    # i "Really not gonna drink?"
    i "真不喝？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10138
translate chinese ivy_meetings_774e74cd:

    # mc "Yeah. No chance."
    mc "嗯。不可能。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10140
translate chinese ivy_meetings_86417fbc:

    # mc "The longer we were together, the more I realized — I didn’t know her at all."
    mc "在一起越久，我越发现——我根本不了解她。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10141
translate chinese ivy_meetings_1fbc3140:

    # mc "And everything happening around us… just kept pressing down harder."
    mc "而我们周围发生的一切……只是越压越重。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10146
translate chinese ivy_meetings_177f518f:

    # i "Your eyes… you’ve been through a lot, haven’t you?"
    i "你的眼睛……你经历了很多，对吧？"

    # game/Story03.rpy:10148
translate chinese ivy_meetings_f575734b:

    # i "Working at the bar gave me some… perspective. And right now, it feels like you’re running on empty."
    i "在酒吧干活给了我点……看人的眼光。而你现在，看着就像油跑干了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10149
translate chinese ivy_meetings_1b698103:

    # i "Maybe it’s time for a little reset? To unwind… what do you think?"
    i "也许该稍微重置一下？放松放松……你觉得呢？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10154
translate chinese ivy_meetings_a9dd689f:

    # i "To be honest, I`m.... A little wet there."
    i "说实话，我……那儿有点湿了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10155
translate chinese ivy_meetings_d6764404:

    # i "And... It`s come out."
    i "而且……它流出来了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10157
translate chinese ivy_meetings_eda93888:

    # mc "The current situation aside..."
    mc "先不说眼下的状况……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10158
translate chinese ivy_meetings_6ccd27b9:

    # mc "(Her unique scent and the odor of her sweat.)"
    mc "（她特有的气味，还有汗味。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:10159
translate chinese ivy_meetings_f263be33:

    # mc "(Keep clouding my mind.)"
    mc "（一直糊着我的脑子。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:10161
translate chinese ivy_meetings_8fd0aa02:

    # mc "(I don`t even know if I shoud be doing this right now.)"
    mc "（我都不知道现在该不该做这事。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:10164
translate chinese ivy_meetings_9679a5de:

    # mc "(But...)"
    mc "（可是……）"

# game/Story03.rpy:10172
translate chinese ivy_meetings_836c2dd8:

    # b "I don`t think I can just sit there and do nothing."
    b "我觉得我没法就那么坐着，什么都不干。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10173
translate chinese ivy_meetings_eaf308af:

    # mc "Bigger than they look. I can admit..."
    mc "比看着的要大。我承认……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10174
translate chinese ivy_meetings_ed91868f:

    # mc "And heavy."
    mc "而且沉。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10175
translate chinese ivy_meetings_3123e11a:

    # i "Mmm… you really don’t waste time, do you?"
    i "嗯……你还真不浪费时间，是吧？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10176
translate chinese ivy_meetings_d0513fad:

    # mc "Hard to resist when you’re this close."
    mc "你离这么近，很难忍住。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10177
translate chinese ivy_meetings_3198b206:

    # i "Ahh… careful— the way you touch me… it makes my head spin."
    i "啊……小心点——你碰我的方式……让我头晕。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10178
translate chinese ivy_meetings_7ffccb94:

    # mc "Then I’ll be gentle… for now."
    mc "那我就温柔点……暂时。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10179
translate chinese ivy_meetings_3c641fc2:

    # i "Don’t tease me like that. Every little move— I can feel it."
    i "别那样逗我。每一个细微的动作——我都能感觉到。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10180
translate chinese ivy_meetings_a343fd67:

    # mc "You’re trembling. Do you like it this much?"
    mc "你在抖。有这么喜欢？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10181
translate chinese ivy_meetings_f9a20d87:

    # i "...More than I’d ever admit. Just… keep going."
    i "……比我会承认的要多得多。就……继续。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10182
translate chinese ivy_meetings_c2ba0730:

    # mc "Tell me what you want, Ivy."
    mc "告诉我你想要什么，艾薇。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10183
translate chinese ivy_meetings_26b27d9b:

    # i "I want… all of you. Right here, right now."
    i "我想要……全部的你。就在这儿，就现在。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10184
translate chinese ivy_meetings_e18d5ae7:

    # i "Mmh… you’re making it hard to think straight."
    i "嗯……你让我没法正常思考了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10185
translate chinese ivy_meetings_2ba1906f:

    # mc "Then don’t think. Just feel."
    mc "那就别想。只管感受。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10186
translate chinese ivy_meetings_189eda96:

    # i "Easy for you to say… I’m the one melting here."
    i "你说得倒轻松……在这化掉的人是我。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10187
translate chinese ivy_meetings_7b03c16e:

    # mc "Good. That means I’m doing something right."
    mc "很好。说明我做对了什么。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10188
translate chinese ivy_meetings_746f6f3f:

    # i "You know, sitting like this… it almost feels like you’re claiming me."
    i "你知道吗，这样坐着……几乎像是你在占有我。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10189
translate chinese ivy_meetings_b4a1a81e:

    # mc "Almost?"
    mc "几乎？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10190
translate chinese ivy_meetings_732fde24:

    # i "Tch, don’t get cocky. I didn’t say I mind."
    i "啧，别得瑟。我可没说介意。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10191
translate chinese ivy_meetings_68fa01f7:

    # mc "I can tell."
    mc "我看得出来。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10192
translate chinese ivy_meetings_df4e3dcf:

    # i "Hah… damn you. Every time I think I’ve got the upper hand, you flip it back on me."
    i "哈……你这家伙。每次我以为占了上风，你就翻回来压我。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10193
translate chinese ivy_meetings_fa89785f:

    # mc "Maybe you never had it to begin with."
    mc "也许你压根就没占过。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10194
translate chinese ivy_meetings_4dd617f1:

    # i "Oh really? Then hold me tighter… and prove it."
    i "哦，是吗？那就抱紧点……证明给我看。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10195
translate chinese ivy_meetings_8894e9a8:

