# game/Story03.rpy:10236
translate chinese ivy_meetings_0e21f15d:

    # i "Good thing I don’t mind getting burned."
    i "幸好我不介意被烧。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10238
translate chinese ivy_meetings_aa6d0f99:

    # i "Mmh… just like that. Don’t stop—"
    i "嗯……就这样。别停——"

