translate chinese ivy_meetings_cc840615:

    # mc "And what happens?"
    mc "会怎么样？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10254
translate chinese ivy_meetings_138dde54:

    # i "I start thinking… maybe I should move… or maybe just… stay right here and make you wait."
    i "我就开始想……也许我该动一下……或者干脆……就待在这儿，让你等着。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10255
translate chinese ivy_meetings_75e6d01c:

    # i "Don’t be so eager… patience, remember? Every second counts."
    i "别那么急……耐心，记得吗？每一秒都算数。"

