translate chinese ivy_meetings_0aa83fd9:

    # i "God… I can feel how tense you are. Every muscle, every heartbeat… it’s delicious."
    i "天哪……我能感觉到你有多绷。每一块肌肉，每一下心跳……太美味了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10257
translate chinese ivy_meetings_e7d3e821:

    # mc "You really enjoy me like this, huh?"
    mc "你还真喜欢我这个样子，是吧？"

