    # i "Feel that? Every move, every touch… you like it, don’t you?"
    i "感觉到了吗？每一个动作，每一次触碰……你喜欢，对吧？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10260
translate chinese ivy_meetings_c7840d7e:

    # mc "Yes… but you’re killing me with this slow torture."
