    # mc "(She’s… she’s driving me insane… every move, every pause… I can’t tell if I should pull her closer or just… stay still.)"
    mc "（她……她快把我逼疯了……每个动作，每次停顿……我都不知道是该把她拉近，还是就……不动。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:10267
translate chinese ivy_meetings_ae4656fd:

    # mc "You know, this slow torture… it’s… almost too much."
    mc "你知道吗，这种慢刀子……几乎……太过了。"

