    # i "You feel that? Every little twitch… your hands, your chest… I can feel how much you want me."
    i "感觉到了吗？每一下细微的抽动……你的手，你的胸口……我能感觉到你有多想要我。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10270
translate chinese ivy_meetings_84f49ce4:

    # mc "I… I do… but you’re enjoying this too much."
    mc "我……我是想……可你享受得太过了。"

