translate chinese ivy_meetings_c198f043:

    # i "Mmh… almost there… can you feel it? Every bit of me…"
    i "嗯……快到了……能感觉到吗？我的每一寸……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10276
translate chinese ivy_meetings_4b5b1119:

    # i "Mmh… yes… right there… don’t stop…"
    i "嗯……对……就是那儿……别停……"

