    # mc "(She’s… she’s incredible. Every shiver, every breath… I can feel how much she wants this, and it’s driving me mad.)"
    mc "（她……她太厉害了。每一次颤抖，每一次呼吸……我能感觉到她有多想要这个，快把我逼疯了。）"

