translate chinese ivy_meetings_9080f952:

    # mc "Ivy… you’re… amazing."
    mc "艾薇……你……太棒了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10279
translate chinese ivy_meetings_e4ae5ca3:

    # i "Don’t… don’t stop… I need… I need all of you…"
    i "别……别停……我要……我要全部的你……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10280
translate chinese ivy_meetings_02a6f352:

    # mc "Ivy… you’re driving me insane…"
    mc "艾薇……你快把我弄疯了……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10281
translate chinese ivy_meetings_f98e94e3:

    # i "Almost… almost there… can you feel it? Every bit of us… connected…"
    i "快了……快到了……能感觉到吗？我们每一寸……都连在一起……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10282
translate chinese ivy_meetings_6c006d29:

    # i "There… yes… I… ahhh…"
    i "就是那儿……对……我……啊啊……"

