    # mc "Why?"
    mc "为什么？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10439
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_e546c89d:

    # L "What are you talking about? Darling, you're—"
    L "你在说什么？亲爱的，你——"

# game/Story03.rpy:10442
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_fd764fa0:

    # mc "(No. Now's not the time for gentle words.)"
    mc "（不。现在不是说软话的时候。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:10443
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_f9382818:

    # mc "What's your real goal?"
    mc "你真正的目的是什么？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10446
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_2f3741ea:

    # L "I don't understand..."
    L "我不明白……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10452
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_ff8c5292:

    # mc "Enough of this charade! I'm tired, Lora! Tired, do you hear me?!"
    mc "别演了！我累了，洛拉！累了，听见了吗？！"

# game/Story03.rpy:10453
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_04a7d34b:

    # mc "You were the reason I dropped everything — to save your ass."
    mc "我抛下一切，就是为了救你的命。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10457
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_5be7e1fc:

    # mc "And then I find out you could've come back the whole time?!"
    mc "结果我发现你一直都能回来？！"

# game/Story03.rpy:10459
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_1700589c:

    # L "Wait… you don't understand—"
    L "等等……你不明白——"

# game/Story03.rpy:10462
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_9aae5d3f:

    # mc "Then explain it to me! Tell me how I'm the one who got it wrong! Come on. Explain!"
    mc "那就给我解释！告诉我错的人怎么是我！来啊。解释！"

# game/Story03.rpy:10465
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_dd111e4b:

    # L "I... I can't."
    L "我……我不能。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10467
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_364203a1:

    # mc "(Shit… everything I did feels like it was for nothing.)"
    mc "（糟了……我做的一切都像是白费。）"

# game/Story03.rpy:10470
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_31520cd5:

    # mc "Fine. Let's go back then! Let's drop it all and start over!"
    mc "行。那我们就回去！把所有都扔下，从头再来！"

# game/Story03.rpy:10471
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_7f8d63fa:

    # mc "Screw saving the planet, screw the elves, screw all this intrigue!"
    mc "去他的救星球，去他的精灵，去他的这些勾心斗角！"

# game/Story03.rpy:10475
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_4ca4d522:

    # L "Do you think I wanted any of this? Do you think I liked it?!"
    L "你以为我想要这些？你以为我喜欢这样？！"

# game/Story03.rpy:10476
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_01af8040:

    # L "Twelve years… thrown away!"
    L "十二年……全扔了！"

# game/Story03.rpy:10480
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_2f0e4ccb:

    # L "I had no choice. Your lives were at stake! I did everything to save you!"
    L "我没得选。你们的命悬在那儿！我做的一切都是为了救你们！"

# game/Story03.rpy:10481
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_1e6da667:

    # L "Every single damn day I spent there bought you another day here!"
    L "我在那儿熬过的每一个该死的日子，都给你们换来这儿的一天！"

# game/Story03.rpy:10486
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_9e434492:

    # mc "Who asked you to do that?! Me?"
    mc "谁让你这么做的？！我？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10487
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_aa541016:

    # mc "I'd rather have died there — happily — with you, than spend all these years alone."
    mc "我宁愿跟你一起死在那儿——高高兴兴地——也不想一个人熬这么多年。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10491
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_f8e72d2e:

    # L "Have you ever even thought what it was like for me?"
    L "你有没有想过，那对我来说是什么滋味？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10492
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_b3570e80:

    # L "Half the time I was surviving by sheer will, trying to make it one more day."
    L "大半时间我全靠意志撑着，只想再多活一天。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10493
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_578e0166:

    # L "In a place where darkness looked brighter than the sun. But I didn't give up — I knew it was for you."
    L "在一个黑暗都比太阳亮的地方。可我没放弃——我知道这是为了你。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10496
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_823b8d2b:

    # L "Call me a hypocrite, I don't care. I'm used to not being appreciated for what I did."
    L "叫我伪君子也行，我不在乎。我早就习惯做的事没人感激了。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10497
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_5db2acef:

    # L "But you're going to live."
    L "可你会活下去。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10499
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_869593cb:

    # L "And believe me, I know about Norman. Or did you think I was that indifferent?"
    L "信我，诺曼的事我知道。还是你觉得我真的那么无动于衷？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10500
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_1547ac8a:

    # L "He was my son too… But I kept quiet so I wouldn't burden you. Apparently that was a mistake."
    L "他也是我儿子……可我闭口不提，免得给你添负担。看来那是错的。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10501
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_55923c8b:

    # L "Why did you go into that Ark? Why couldn't you just live in peace?"
    L "你为什么要进那个方舟？你为什么就不能安安稳稳地活着？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10504
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_1f80f353:

    # mc "What did you want me to do?! He came to me with information about you! Was I supposed to just sit and wait?!"
    mc "你想让我怎么办？！他带着你的消息来找我！我该干坐着等吗？！"

# game/Story03.rpy:10507
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_3766b216:

    # mc "Living out my days wondering — are you alive or dead?! Yeah, Lora… brilliant idea…"
    mc "让我余生都在猜——你是死是活？！是啊，洛拉……好主意……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10510
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_2d35b52f:

    # mc "Why… why didn't you come back?"
    mc "为什么……你为什么不回来？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10512
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_ef1d7b8a:

    # L "Please… understand. I… couldn't."
    L "求你……理解我。我……不能。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10516
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_cf545654:

    # L "I swore an oath… if I broke it, she'd come after you."
    L "我立过誓……要是违背了，她会来找你。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10519
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_815d9406:

    # L "And then everything would be for nothing again!"
    L "那一切就又白费了！"

# game/Story03.rpy:10523
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_0f9d641a:

    # mc "She? Who is she?"
    mc "她？她是谁？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10530
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_c2cc2445:

    # L "No… what have I done…"
    L "不……我做了什么……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10532
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_7ec969d5:

    # mc "Lora, what are you talking about?"
    mc "洛拉，你在说什么？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10537
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_ad52bfd7:

    # L "You have to go… right now."
    L "你得走……现在就走。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10539
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_41895de9:

    # L "Run… while she still—"
    L "跑……趁她还没——"

# game/Story03.rpy:10542
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_d7b42565:

    # sel "..."
    sel "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10548
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_3184a9b8:

    # mc "Wha—"
    mc "什么——"

# game/Story03.rpy:10550
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_9993b94e_3:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story03.rpy:10551
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_790b98d6:

    # sel "We told you, didn't we?"
    sel "我们说过，对吧？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10555
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_61a2f7d7:

    # L "NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!"
    L "不——！！"

# game/Story03.rpy:10573
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_6bf21d6a:

    # n "This is the end of the current route. To clarify, this route will be available in future updates, though I can’t say which ones."
    n "当前路线到此结束。说明一下，这条路线会在后续更新中开放，但我不能确定是哪些更新。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10574
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_ffaa1dbe:

    # n "For now, would you like to continue the game through a different route?"
    n "现在，你想通过另一条路线继续游戏吗？"

# game/Story03.rpy:10578
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_e5c128a1:

    # n "Excellent. Enjoy your time."
    n "太好了。玩得开心。"

# game/Story03.rpy:10583
translate chinese endof3_5chapter_05814108:

    # n "Well then, that’s all for now. If you’d like, you can check out my other project. Peace and goodwill."
    n "那么，目前就到这里。有兴趣的话，可以去看看我的另一个项目。平安顺遂。"

